  "releaseNotes": "Initial release with RFC 9457 Problem Details, exception mapping, trace identifiers, and extension callbacks.\n      1.1.0: Targets net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0 (previously net8.0 only). No public API or behavior change; the net9.0 and net10.0 assets are new, and the net8.0 assembly is unchanged. The nuspec no longer declares Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions and Microsoft.Extensions.Options as package dependencies: both assemblies ship in the Microsoft.AspNetCore.App framework reference the package already carries, so consumers are unaffected.",
